From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Omarchybot
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 10:00:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/24] Install rtkit on fresh installs and restart the portal
 before PipeWire

omarchy-other.packages only seeds the ISO's offline mirror; the installer pacstraps omarchy-base.packages, so rtkit listed only in the other list never reaches a fresh install, and fresh installs mark this migration done.

xdg-desktop-portal reads rtkit's RTTimeUSecMax once, at startup. Restarting the audio units while it still reports 0 gave WirePlumber, and the shell as it reconnected, a hard RLIMIT_RTTIME of 0 with SCHED_RR data loops. Restarting the portal first gives them 200000 us like the daemon.

Upstream: omacom/omarchy#12428

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
Backport-of: dac602f5f30f451dca5ac04da02fd89fd3fe5a35

(cherry picked from commit dac602f5f30f451dca5ac04da02fd89fd3fe5a35)
---
 install/omarchy-base.packages  | 1 +
 install/omarchy-other.packages | 1 -
 migrations/1789747667.sh       | 4 ++++
 3 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/install/omarchy-base.packages b/install/omarchy-base.packages
index a8affbf2..e20674fd 100644
--- a/install/omarchy-base.packages
+++ b/install/omarchy-base.packages
@@ -125,6 +125,7 @@ qrencode
 qt6-imageformats
 quickshell
 ripgrep
+rtkit
 ruby
 sddm
 signed
diff --git a/install/omarchy-other.packages b/install/omarchy-other.packages
index a3edbf42..7183ac3c 100644
--- a/install/omarchy-other.packages
+++ b/install/omarchy-other.packages
@@ -37,7 +37,6 @@ pipewire-jack
 pipewire-libcamera
 pipewire-pulse
 qt6-wayland
-rtkit
 snapper
 sof-firmware
 thermald
diff --git a/migrations/1789747667.sh b/migrations/1789747667.sh
index dac3cfca..47e979b3 100644
--- a/migrations/1789747667.sh
+++ b/migrations/1789747667.sh
@@ -7,6 +7,10 @@ echo "Install rtkit so PipeWire gets realtime priority"
 # sustained load.
 omarchy-pkg-add rtkit
 
+# The portal reads rtkit's realtime budget once, so restart it first: PipeWire
+# clients that reconnect to a stale portal take a hard RLIMIT_RTTIME of 0.
+systemctl --user try-restart xdg-desktop-portal.service 2>/dev/null || true
+
 # rtkit only takes effect when PipeWire re-requests priority at startup.
 # Restart the audio units if they are running; harmless when idle or as root.
 systemctl --user try-restart pipewire.service pipewire-pulse.service wireplumber.service 2>/dev/null || true
